  skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.ml-platform>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.technical-debt>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.entanglement>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.undeclared-consumers>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.mlops-maturity>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.ml-roles>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.glue-code>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.pipeline-jungle>, <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/concept/mlsys.build-vs-buy> .

